Facet 0: review_sentiment (categorical)
  Captures the overall evaluative sentiment the reviewer expresses toward the product, ranging from satisfaction to dissatisfaction.
  - positive
  - negative
  - mixed
  - Other

Facet 1: review_focus_aspect (categorical)
  Captures which product attribute the reviewer primarily evaluates or emphasizes in their review.
  - price_and_value
  - durability_and_longevity
